<title>UK: House of Fraser names Adams finance director.</title>
<headline>House of Fraser names Adams finance director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>British department store House of Fraser Plc said on Monday that it has appointed David Adams as finance director.  </p>
<p>Adams is currently finance director of the Asprey Group.</p>
<p>Former finance director Richard Scott left the company &quot;by mutual agreement&quot; in November 1996.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
